# The image needs only the workspace metadata, the lock file and server/ (see Dockerfile).
# Everything else stays out of the build context, above all local secrets and trace files.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!server/pyproject.toml
!server/README.md
!server/LICENSE
!server/src/**
!sdk/python/pyproject.toml
!sdk/python/README.md
!sdk/python/LICENSE
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
